[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.0, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "不要碰我。 我不愿意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11342.56, "timestamp": "03:09:02", "text": "我不愿意。 可不是小家伙。我是一名轮式车手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11344.72, "timestamp": "03:09:04", "text": "可不是小家伙。我是一名轮式车手 生物。你碰不到我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11346.319, "timestamp": "03:09:06", "text": "生物。你碰不到我。 顺便提一句，简单提一下。嗯，龙的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11348.64, "timestamp": "03:09:08", "text": "顺便提一句，简单提一下。嗯，龙的 呼吸即专注。所以，如果你施放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11350.399, "timestamp": "03:09:10", "text": "呼吸即专注。所以，如果你施放 另一个旧的将会消失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11354.8, "timestamp": "03:09:14", "text": "另一个旧的将会消失。 别再爆胎了，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11356.16, "timestamp": "03:09:16", "text": "别再爆胎了，伙计。 是的。是的，旧的那个将会消失。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.12, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "是的。是的，旧的那个将会消失。 我需要某种方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11366.309, "timestamp": "03:09:26", "text": "嗯，攻击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11368.07, "timestamp": "03:09:28", "text": "虫害。虫害肆虐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11373.349, "timestamp": "03:09:33", "text": "你得了罐头撕裂。可以去旅行。虫害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11375.11, "timestamp": "03:09:35", "text": "我太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.03, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "你知道吗？如果我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11386.469, "timestamp": "03:09:46", "text": "有人能很快变成寄生虫吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11387.91, "timestamp": "03:09:47", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11389.99, "timestamp": "03:09:49", "text": "就像我们之前说的那样，绦虫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11392.63, "timestamp": "03:09:52", "text": "绦虫。哦，寄生虫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11393.75, "timestamp": "03:09:53", "text": "绦虫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11396.55, "timestamp": "03:09:56", "text": "感觉就像要吐出一条绦虫一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11399.269, "timestamp": "03:09:59", "text": "不，是魔法绦虫。"}]